    "detailed_description": "Welcome to Kitten Kingdom, a charming 2D platformer game that's perfect for players of all ages. In this game, you'll join a group of adorable kittens as they run and jump through a vast, colorful world filled with money to collect and dangerous dogs to avoid.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nAs you explore the immersive world of Kitten Kingdom, you'll be able to escape the monotony of everyday life and lose yourself in hours of engaging gameplay. The cute graphics will keep you coming back for more. And the amazing soundtrack will have you humming along as you play.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nSo why wait? Start playing Kitten Kingdom today and experience the fun and joy of this charming game. With its engaging gameplay, cute graphics, and amazing soundtrack, it's sure to delight players of all ages.",
